---
const processImg = "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/ba5d94c5/images/a8a51ab43_generated_image-1024.webp";
---

<section id="werkwijze" class="bg-dark py-[112px]" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:ghi123">
  <div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:pg62h1">
    <div class="text-center mb-16" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:pg62h2">
      <span class="text-primary text-[14px] font-bold tracking-[2px] uppercase block mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:wp7cfs">Onze Werkwijze</span>
      <h2 class="text-[42px] font-normal text-white leading-tight mb-8" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:985gpx">Van eerste gesprek tot sleuteloverdracht</h2>
      <div class="bg-white/5 rounded-full p-2 pl-6 inline-flex items-center gap-6 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm max-w-full overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:pg62h3">
        <span class="text-white font-medium text-[15px]" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:wp7cft">Heeft u een project te bespreken?</span>
        <a href="/#contact" class="px-6 py-2 bg-primary text-white text-[14px] font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:sk6y22">
          Neem contact op
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:pg62h4">
      <div class="reveal" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc74">
        <img src={processImg} alt="Architectonisch proces" class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-2xl" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:mxwy5k" />
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 reveal reveal-delay-1" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc75">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <details class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden" open>
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc76">
              <span class="text-[24px] font-bold text-primary/50 group-open:text-primary transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:wp7cfu">01</span>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:nwkdxl">Intake & Planning</h3>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white/40 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 ml-12 border-t border-white/5" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc77">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-dark-muted" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:lg91d0">
              We starten met een persoonlijk gesprek om uw wensen, budget en planning in kaart te brengen. Op basis hiervan stellen we een concreet plan van aanpak op, inclusief tekeningen en materiaallijsten.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <details class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc78">
              <span class="text-[24px] font-bold text-primary/50 group-open:text-primary transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:wp7cfv">02</span>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:nwkdxk">Vergunningen & Voorbereiding</h3>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white/40 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 ml-12 border-t border-white/5" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc79">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-dark-muted" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:lg91d1">
              Wij verzorgen indien nodig the vergunningsaanvragen en treffen alle technische voorbereidingen. Zo komt u nooit voor verrassingen te staan tijdens de bouw.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <details class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc7a">
              <span class="text-[24px] font-bold text-primary/50 group-open:text-primary transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:wp7cfw">03</span>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:nwkdxj">Uitvoering & Bouw</h3>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white/40 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 ml-12 border-t border-white/5" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc7b">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-dark-muted" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:lg91d2">
              Onze vakmensen gaan aan de slag. Gedurende het proces houden we nauw contact en bewaken we de planning en kwaliteit tot op de millimeter nauwkeurig.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <details class="group bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc7c">
              <span class="text-[24px] font-bold text-primary/50 group-open:text-primary transition-colors" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:wp7cfx">04</span>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:nwkdxi">Oplevering & Nazorg</h3>
            </div>
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white/40 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" /></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="p-6 pt-0 ml-12 border-t border-white/5" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:j5gc7d">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-dark-muted" data-ps="src/components/home/ProcessAccordion.astro:lg91d3">
              Na de laatste handeling lopen we alles samen na. We dragen de sleutel over en u geniet van uw nieuwe ruimte met de volledige BouwGarant zekerheid.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
</style>
